DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31264::$$$message_0239_0000_0000$$$::The moment I decide to step outside, I feel unwell.[lr]::
31265::$$$message_0239_0000_0001$$$::Is it a gut feeling, or familiar terror?[lr]::
31266::$$$message_0239_0000_0002$$$::I know it's time to leave, but I feel a little timid.[lr]::
31267::$$$message_0239_0000_0003$$$::"...Better go see what's happening around town."[lr]::
31268::$$$message_0239_0000_0004$$$::I get up and reach for the sliding door.::
31269::$$$message_0239_0001_0000$$$::Just before I depart...[lr]::
31270::$$$message_0239_0001_0001$$$::I take one look back at my room and engrave its sight into my memory.::
31271::$$$message_0239_0002_0000$$$::The night is frigid.[lr]::
31272::$$$message_0239_0002_0001$$$::As soon as I step outside, I feel as if I've been thrust into a different world.[lr]::
31273::$$$message_0239_0002_0002$$$::The only part of it that feels real is the Emiya house, while the rest of Fuyuki flickers like a mirage.::
31274::$$$message_0239_0003_0000$$$::                                 "DiSAppEAR [wait canskip=0 time=400][se volume=60 storage=se620.wav]diSApPeAr [wait canskip=0 time=300]dISAppEar"[rf]::
31275::$$$message_0239_0004_0000$$$::I can hear bestial panting through the mist.[lr]::
31276::$$$message_0239_0004_0001$$$::...There's no sign of anyone in town. I don't know who's responsible for this situation, but they've finally shown their true colors.::
31277::$$$message_0239_0005_0000$$$::                                        "kill yoU [wait canskip=0 time=400][se volume=60 storage=se623.wav]KILL yOu [wait canskip=0 time=300]kIll You"[rf]::
31278::$$$message_0239_0006_0000$$$::"Nobody's here... It's really like..."[lr]::
31279::$$$message_0239_0006_0001$$$::A world where everything's died.[lr]::
31280::$$$message_0239_0006_0002$$$::All I see are ruined houses.[lr]::
31281::$$$message_0239_0006_0003$$$::Broken doors.[lr]::
31282::$$$message_0239_0006_0004$$$::Smashed windows.[lr]::
31283::$$$message_0239_0006_0005$$$::Bloodied gardens.[lr]::
31284::$$$message_0239_0006_0006$$$::And when I look inside...[lr]::
31285::$$$message_0239_0006_0007$$$::I see the remains of utter butchery.::
31286::$$$message_0239_0007_0000$$$::Everything's wrong.[lr]::
31287::$$$message_0239_0007_0001$$$::What's especially off is how there isn't a single dismembered hunk of flesh or dead person in sight.[lr]::
31288::$$$message_0239_0007_0002$$$::Still, it's crystal clear what happened here.[lr]::
31289::$$$message_0239_0007_0003$$$::"......"[lr]::
31290::$$$message_0239_0007_0004$$$::Unknown emotions irritate my brain.[lr]::
31291::$$$message_0239_0007_0005$$$::An exquisite balance of rage and disgust fills my mind.[lr]::
31292::$$$message_0239_0007_0006$$$::I despise a mass murderer I've yet to lay eyes on.::
31293::$$$message_0239_0008_0000$$$::                 "CAN'T SEe [wait canskip=0 time=400]cAN't SEe [wait canskip=0 time=300]i CAN't sEE aNything ANyMORE!"[rf]::
31294::$$$message_0239_0009_0000$$$::"...Who are you? What the hell are you!?"[lr]::
31295::$$$message_0239_0009_0001$$$::I follow the echoing rasps.[lr]::
31296::$$$message_0239_0009_0002$$$::The howls are a voiceless voice, directed at me.[lr]::
31297::$$$message_0239_0009_0003$$$::Animosity and appeal are directed at me from all sides. Enmity and envy.[lr]::
31298::$$$message_0239_0009_0004$$$::I feel so revolted, I want to vomit.::
31299::$$$message_0239_0010_0000$$$::     "I hAte/eNVY YOu [wait canskip=0 time=100]i HATE/EnVY You [wait canskip=0 time=100]i HAte/eNVY you [wait canskip=0 time=100]i Hate/ENvY YoU"[rf]::
31300::$$$message_0239_0011_0000$$$::Howls turn into roars.[lr]::
31301::$$$message_0239_0011_0001$$$::As much as I want to deny it, the thing that's howling is right in front of me.::
31302::$$$message_0239_0012_0000$$$::"What...the hell..."[lr]::
31303::$$$message_0239_0012_0001$$$::I've seen this somewhere before, but I can't recall where right now.[lr]::
31304::$$$message_0239_0012_0002$$$::Just a little longer. Once midnight passes, I'll remember if someone tells me.::
31305::$$$message_0239_0013_0000$$$::"                "[wvs][se storage=se622.wav][rf][lr]::
31306::$$$message_0239_0013_0001$$$::It creaks[stopnoise] and howls.[lr]::
31307::$$$message_0239_0013_0002$$$::It's in a frequency outside of audible range. [noise opacity=100]The thing howls in a voice no human can hear.[stopnoise]::
31308::$$$message_0239_0014_0000$$$::                            "...do You OnLY wANt [wait canskip=0 time=200]tO SaVe yoUrselF?"[rf]::
31309::$$$message_0239_0015_0000$$$::The beast rears its head.[lr]::
31310::$$$message_0239_0015_0001$$$::It looks at me and charges with a shrieking rake of its claws.::
31311::$$$message_0239_0016_0000$$$::"Ngh!"[lr]::
31312::$$$message_0239_0016_0001$$$::I leap backwards out of the way.[lr]::
31313::$$$message_0239_0016_0002$$$::The beast wildly swipes at me.[lr]::
31314::$$$message_0239_0016_0003$$$::If those guillotine-like claws get me, I'm finished.[lr]::
31315::$$$message_0239_0016_0004$$$::But this isn't my first rodeo.[lr]::
31316::$$$message_0239_0016_0005$$$::Compared to sparring with Saber, this is child's play.::
31317::$$$message_0239_0017_0000$$$::It has little chance of hitting me, [se storage=se095.wav]but the beast keeps attacking obsessively.[lr]::
31318::$$$message_0239_0017_0001$$$::With each attack, [se storage=se614.wav]the swings become fiercer, and it seems like there's no end to them.[se storage=se620.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se094.wav][lr]::
31319::$$$message_0239_0017_0002$$$::                                 "oNLY yOU, onlY YOU, oNlY yoU...!"[rf][lr]::
31320::$$$message_0239_0017_0003$$$::It spits its words, [se storage=se612.wav]voice darkening by the moment.[wsplinemove canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][shock vmax=25 time=300 count=-3][se storage=se092.wav]::
31321::$$$message_0239_0018_0000$$$::"Hah... Crap, I[line len=2]"[lr]::
31322::$$$message_0239_0018_0001$$$::I counterattack on reflex, even though I could've kept evading it no problem. I sidestep the beast's claws and kick its exposed belly with full force.[lr]::
31323::$$$message_0239_0018_0002$$$::...It isn't much of a threat after all.[lr]::
31324::$$$message_0239_0018_0003$$$::The unknown beast writhes on all fours, unable to get up.::
31325::$$$message_0239_0019_0000$$$::                                                   "...Gr...ant..."[rf]::
31326::$$$message_0239_0020_0000$$$::"Hey, if you understand me, then answer. Are you the one who did this to the town?"[lr]::
31327::$$$message_0239_0020_0001$$$::That can't be possible.[lr]::
31328::$$$message_0239_0020_0002$$$::Most people would be helpless to defend themselves against this thing, yes.[lr]::
31329::$$$message_0239_0020_0003$$$::But there's only so much it can do.[lr]::
31330::$$$message_0239_0020_0004$$$::It wouldn't be possible for this thing to depopulate the entire town in the span of an hour.::
31331::$$$message_0239_0021_0000$$$::                                                   [noise opacity=80]"...Grr...ant..."[rf]::
31332::$$$message_0239_0022_0000$$$::"...You still don't get it. That's not what I'm asking you. I want to know[line len=2]"[lr]::
31333::$$$message_0239_0022_0001$$$::Just as I'm about to say "who you are"...[lr]::
31334::$$$message_0239_0022_0002$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
31335::$$$message_0239_0022_0003$$$::I realize that it's smothering everything around me.::
31336::$$$message_0239_0023_0000$$$::                                                          [se storage=se627.wav]"...!"[nolr][br]                                                          [se storage=se623.wav]"...!"[nolr][br]                                                          [se storage=se629.wav]"...!"[wdash canskip=0][rf]::
31337::$$$message_0239_0024_0000$$$::Myriad malign voices moan in unison.[se storage=se625.wav][lr]::
31338::$$$message_0239_0024_0001$$$::A swarm of beasts has overrun the park.[se storage=se629.wav][lr]::
31339::$$$message_0239_0024_0002$$$::...Damn it. If there's this many of them, [se storage=se624.wav]it would take them twenty minutes to clean out the entire town, never mind an hour.[wdash canskip=0]::
31340::$$$message_0239_0025_0000$$$::                                                          [se storage=se627.wav]"...!"[nolr][br]                                                          [se storage=se624.wav]"...!"[nolr][br]                                                          [se storage=se629.wav]"...!"[wdash canskip=0][rf]::
31341::$$$message_0239_0026_0000$$$::...The snarling tsunami rushes in at me.[lr]::
31342::$$$message_0239_0026_0001$$$::It evokes an image of a corpse overrun by ants, or a dead man dropped onto the Buddhist hell of a mountain of needles.[lr]::
31343::$$$message_0239_0026_0002$$$::"...Rrgh."[lr]::
31344::$$$message_0239_0026_0003$$$::Those claws will tear me to ribbons.[lr]::
31345::$$$message_0239_0026_0004$$$::They'll skewer every inch of my body, from my skull to my eyeballs.[lr]::
31346::$$$message_0239_0026_0005$$$::I press my hands together in prayer.[se storage=se623.wav][lr]::
31347::$$$message_0239_0026_0006$$$::There's nothing [se storage=se625.wav]left I can do now.[se storage=se624.wav]::
31348::$$$message_0239_0027_0000$$$::                                                         "..., !"[nolr][br]::
31349::$$$message_0239_0027_0001$$$::                                                         "..., !"[nolr][br]::
31350::$$$message_0239_0027_0002$$$::                                                   "...our...wish!"[rf][se storage=se620.wav][se storage=se623.wav]::
31351::$$$message_0239_0028_0000$$$::Ugh, shut up. If you're gonna kill me, just do it already.[se storage=se628.wav][lr]::
31352::$$$message_0239_0028_0001$$$::You just keep flailing around[se storage=se629.wav] like an idiot! [se storage=se624.wav]If you've got something to say, say it![se storage=se624.wav]::
31353::$$$message_0239_0029_0000$$$::"Can't you understand them?[lr]::
31354::$$$message_0239_0029_0001$$$::They're telling you to grant their wishes."::
31355::$$$message_0239_0030_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31356::$$$message_0239_0030_0001$$$::                                                          I reflexively look up at[lr]::
31357::$$$message_0239_0030_0002$$$::                                                          the sound of a beautiful silver voice.[lr]::
31358::$$$message_0239_0030_0003$$$::              In the midst of a savage sea that threatens to bury the world,[lr]::
31359::$$$message_0239_0030_0004$$$::                                         stands a primordial figure.::
31360::$$$message_0239_0031_0000$$$::"You..."[lr]::
31361::$$$message_0239_0031_0001$$$::I know her. I know this woman.[lr]::
31362::$$$message_0239_0031_0002$$$::But that isn't for another hour from now.[lr]::
31363::$$$message_0239_0031_0003$$$::I feel vexed. It doesn't line up.[lr]::
31364::$$$message_0239_0031_0004$$$::Everything's shut off, even though everything's in place. ::
31365::$$$message_0239_0032_0000$$$::"But you failed.[lr]::
31366::$$$message_0239_0032_0001$$$::It seems it's still too early for you to be here."[lr]::
31367::$$$message_0239_0032_0002$$$::The horde of beasts closes in.[lr]::
31368::$$$message_0239_0032_0003$$$::Inescapable death approaches.[lr]::
31369::$$$message_0239_0032_0004$$$::Though, even if I did run, it wouldn't change my fate.::
31370::$$$message_0239_0033_0000$$$::"Begone, sinner.[lr]::
31371::$$$message_0239_0033_0001$$$::There is no longer any place for you on this earth."[lr]::
31372::$$$message_0239_0033_0002$$$::The girl utters a final notice, like a prayer.[lr]::
31373::$$$message_0239_0033_0003$$$::She closes her eyes. Overjoyed, the chorus of beasts pulls Shirou Emiya's body apart.::
31374::$$$message_0239_0034_0000$$$::...And so the proliferation of wickedness continues.[lr]::
31375::$$$message_0239_0034_0001$$$::The night of October 11th.[lr]::
31376::$$$message_0239_0034_0002$$$::Fuyuki City has come to its end under a mountain of corpses.::
931361::$$$message_9239_0031_0001$$$::I know her. I know this woman.[r]::
0